the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 14.

the actions are:
    the move a with *an index* is made; known as a.
    the move b with *an index* is made; known as b.
    the move c with *an index* is made; known as c.

the fluents are:
    control *a thing*; known as control.
    *an index* is a p; known as p.
    *an index* is a q; known as q.
    *an index* is a r; known as r.
    *an index* is the step of *a thing*; known as step.
    the goal of *a role* is *a number*; known as goal.
    the move a with *an index* is legal; known as legal_a.
    the move b with *an index* is legal; known as legal_b.
    the move c with *an index* is legal; known as legal_c.
    the game is terminal; known as terminal.

the templates are:
    *an index* is an index.
    the successor of *a thing* is *a second thing*.

the knowledge base multiplebuttonsandlights includes:

the text of the game is at "sources/multiplebuttonsandlights.hrf".

